{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Which you shall see from there.</b> And you will be able to set your eyes upon them for evil." "<b>Only its edge you shall see, and not all of it.</b> Do not set your eyes upon all of them, so that you not attain your intended purpose at all, as it says (Jeremiah 46:28): כִּי אֶעֱשֶׂה כָלָה בְּכָל הַגּוֹיִם וְאוֹתְךָ לֹא אֶעֱשֶׂה כָלָה."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:53.599545056Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}